    "name": "OMDb ID Parameter Title Parameter API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Open Movie Database REST API providing movie and TV show metadata, ratings, poster images, and episode data from a community-maintained database. Supports lookup by IMDb ID or title, full-text search, and a dedicated Poster API for high-resolution cover art available to patrons. This API requires authorization — get a free key at https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx\n\n\nContact Support:\n Email: bfritz@fadingsignal.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
